      "name": "about",
      "title": "ABOUT US",
      "content": "We are one of the happy couples in the city of Los Santos (Nusa V)! our first meet was at the Casino parking on 21-02-24. an because her car was lost, continued on 27-02-24 confessing to having a relationship, we went through the hard times, laughing and crying together and until 24-04-24 we decided to propose until finally on 29-06-24 we finally got married.\n\nPlease pray for us to continue together until the our end yaa!",
